Releasing version mvm03a.  For those who would like a little
assistance playing the inventory game, sometimes the monk will start
with a sack.

http://www.jcatena.net/nethack/patches.shtml#mvm

I understand that I'm not getting much feedback cause my patches break
saves and bones files, but I hope someone out there is enjoying them
(I am :).

DETAILS SPOILER:

Before any of the other optional items are checked, a sack is
generated one-fifth of the time.  The chances for the monk's other
starting items are the same, but will be seen less since the sack will
be seen more.

To be honest, I feel the progression of abilities, intrinsics, certain
skills, and void, since they relate to (super)natural abilities, are
closer to the feel of a monk than wizardish magic.  I know there's chi
power, so I can understand why monks have a magic-ish bent (starting
with certain spellbooks, and sometimes a magic marker).

